@host = http://localhost:8080
@access_token = <access_token user A из 00_flow.http>

### Happy path → 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general"
}

# Status 201
# Body: {"id":"<uuid>","ownerId":"<uid>","name":"general","createdAt":"..."}

### Без токена → 401 AUTH-010
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general"
}

# Status 401
# Body: {"error":{"code":"AUTH-010","message":"access token invalid"}}

### Пустое name → 400 ROOM-001
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

# Status 400
# Body: {"error":{"code":"ROOM-001","message":"invalid room name"}}

### Битый JSON → 400 ROOM-009
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{not json}

# Status 400
# Body: {"error":{"code":"ROOM-009","message":"invalid request body"}}
